# name: run_policy
# description: push the ball to the goal you marked, using the controller in policies/current.py
# triggers: run the policy, run the controller, run the evolved controller, run policy
# plan: push the ball to your goal with the loaded controller@RUN_POLICY
#
# Copy the controller to test to policies/current.py on the robot first (the
# folder is git-ignored). Mark the ball goal in the web UI like PUSH_TO_GOAL.
# Each run is logged to ~/policy_runs/ (one JSON line per 0.1 s tick).

SET r = RUN_POLICY("policies/current.py")
PRINT "Result:"
PRINT r
